    <string name="info_text">TrackDog listens to the reports your tracker posts on its private MeshCore channel. The phone connects by Bluetooth to the companion radio you carry; the app keeps the connection in the background, takes every report out of the radio at once and stores the trail on the phone.\n\nThe channel must be set on the companion radio (official MeshCore app). TrackDog never transmits over LoRa and uses the internet only to download a map when you ask for it.</string>
